## Endpoints

```
GET    /api/routing-rules
POST   /api/routing-rules                body: {"rules": [...]}
POST   /api/routing-rules/test           body: {"task": "..."}
                                         response: {"matched": bool, "backend": "...", "pattern": "..."}
